5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think we should be careful about how these programs are sustained. I'd like to look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree that sustainability is key. I'll look into the readmission figures during the call-back trial and what the booking system records to see what actually works.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll focus on the human element. I want to see the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking at this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. We need to be realistic about the actual finances.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the physical constraints of our facility. I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and the data agreements with outside surgeries.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,It seems we have a comprehensive plan for our research. Does anyone feel we are missing a critical perspective before we proceed with these selections?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. By looking at both the financial and operational data, we should be able to avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. As long as we consider the current staffing levels alongside the budget, we can make a decision that doesn't overburden the teams.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. Logic dictates that a program is only as viable as its funding and its staff. I'm curious to see if the numbers actually support the ambitions of the proposals.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I feel much more at ease knowing we are considering the practicalities. I look forward to seeing if our infrastructure can truly support a new initiative.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Since we are all in agreement, I think we can move forward. I'm hopeful that these insights will help us choose a program that truly benefits the community long-term.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'm also hopeful. It's better to be thorough now than to realize we've failed our patients a year from now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll be waiting to see the results. It's important that we don't just look at the numbers, but at the people who will actually be doing the work.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I agree, though the ""people"" are often just numbers in a budget. Let's see if the data reveals any inconvenient truths about our capacity.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I believe kindness and patience are just as important as data. I hope we can find a solution that is gentle on everyone involved.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I think we have said all we need to for now. I'll mark these as my final choices and wait for the findings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
