22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will do the same. I'm ready to see what the records tell us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll finalize my selections as well. I'm ready to see the staffing reality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll finalize mine too. Let's see if the ledger is as optimistic as the proposals.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will finalize my choices as well. I hope the results guide us toward a peaceful and sustainable decision.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
