64,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Now that we see the candidates, the Perinatal Support Service seems ideal. It uses the midwifery slack Misaki found and avoids the funding and space issues Shion and Shizue highlighted.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Shion"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. The Perinatal Support Service is the most sustainable choice, as it avoids the pitfalls of unrecorded coordination and the instability of external funding that plagued previous trials.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I strongly support the Perinatal Support Service. It's the only option that leverages the available midwifery capacity without putting more pressure on the already exhausted ward nursing staff.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Shion,,"It is the only logical choice. It avoids the tariff issues of home visits and the space constraints of a new unit, while utilizing existing staff slack. I vote for the Perinatal Support Service.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I agree completely. It seems the most gentle approach for our staff and the most practical for our facilities. I also vote for the Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"Since we are all in agreement, I will also cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service. It feels like the most harmonious choice for everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service as well. It is the only proposal that aligns with the evidence we have gathered.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service too. It's the only one that makes sense for our current staffing levels.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Shion,,"I have already cast my vote, but for the sake of the record, I reiterate my support for the Perinatal Support Service. It is the only fiscally responsible option.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I have also cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service. It is the most sensible way to help our community without overwhelming our hospital.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,It seems we have reached a unanimous decision. I am glad we were able to look at the data and find a path that supports both our staff and our patients.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is a rare satisfaction to see a decision based on evidence rather than optimism. I believe we have successfully avoided the cycle of failed initiatives.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm just relieved that we've found a way to provide a new service without sacrificing the well-being of the nursing teams.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,Shion,,"It was a simple matter of elimination. By identifying the constraints first, the only viable answer became obvious. I'm satisfied with this result.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am happy that we could all agree so kindly. It is a comfort to know that our decision will bring help to new parents without causing stress to our dear staff.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Midori,,I believe we can now conclude this meeting with confidence. I'll ensure the final decision is recorded and communicated to the departments.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will assist in documenting the rationale behind this choice to ensure the program's longevity. I'm satisfied with our process.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll make sure the midwifery team is informed and supportive of the transition. I'm glad we took the time to look at the rosters first.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,3,4,talk,Shion,,I'll keep an eye on the ledger to ensure the funding is actually allocated as promised. Let's hope this one doesn't vanish after twelve months.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
83,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I will keep everyone in my thoughts and hope this new service brings much joy to the families it helps. I am glad we worked together so peacefully.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
